        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Nausea and vomiting"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Sudden nausea yesterday morning followed by multiple episodes of non-bilious, non-bloody vomiting: 5–6 episodes in the first 12 hours. Now easing; last small vomit this morning. No coffee-ground vomit."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
